{"type":"match","data":{"path":{"text":"en.wikipedia.org/Life (American TV series) - Wikipedia.txt"},"lines":{"text":"*Jennifer Conover (Jennifer Siebel) is Charlie Crews' ex-wife who, not believing his innocence, divorced him when he was in prison, and in the 12 years he has been in prison, she has remarried and had a son and daughter. After Crews is released, he regularly approaches her, having never given up his feelings. Initially her viewpoint towards him is strained, but in the middle of Season 2, Jennifer finally succumbed to his advances and they had a night of passion, which was the closure to their relationship.\n"},"line_number":69,"absolute_offset":18760,"submatches":[{"match":{"text":"Siebel"},"start":28,"end":34}]}}
